        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SDML334, Brass Screen Door Mortise Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis decorative all brass construction mortise lockset is for screen doors, patio doors, and storm doors. It has a solid brass door lever on the inside with a solid brass door knob on the outside. The interior lever has a very short projection off the door of only 1-1/8\", making it perfect for close fitting storm doors. Mortise latches are very durable making them the best choice for heavier screen and storm doors without sacrificing style. Adjustable for 7/8\" to  1-3/4\" thick doors. This screen door latch set is available in 9 finish choices to match your decor. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/OMN-29-specifications.gif?v=1704442260\" width=\"330\" height=\"300\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana SDML334 mortise latch size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/low-profile-residential-door-closer-global-tc901\"><b>Low Profile Door Closer</b></a>, perfect for even heavy storm doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana SDML334 Screen Door Mortise Locks:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Case Depth: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mortise Case Height: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Faceplate Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Faceplate Height: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Escutcheon Plate Width: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Escutcheon Plate Height: 4-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 7/8\" -  1-3/4\" Thick Doors</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Knob Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Lever Projection: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Privacy button locks spindle & latch bolt </li>\r\n<li>Reversible Handling</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SDML334.pdf?v=1691095374\" target =\"new\"><b>Deltana SDML334 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SDML334-installation-instructions.pdf?v=1691095376\" target =\"new\"><b>Deltana SDML334 Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
